 It may have been reopened or the number reused. I could not confirm which from these sources.\n- The 5/4 digest calls #8841 Gideon's industrial account. The cheat sheet and 5/3 digest put Vantorre Group with you. Ownership of that ticket is unclear.\n- The 8/3 Hartford digest describes the Aug 3 outage but gives no ticket number. I did not count it separately.\n- I did not search channels you cannot see, so tickets raised in other conversations are not included."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
